# Line endings are decided here, once, rather than by whichever editor and
# operating system a contributor happens to have. Without this a Windows save
# rewrites every line of a file with CRLF, and the whole file shows up as
# changed when a single word moved — which happened here and cost an afternoon
# working out that nothing had really changed at all.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Nothing to normalise in these, and trying would corrupt them.
*.png binary
*.woff binary
*.vsix binary
